    "name": "SporeBloom: Mycelium Master",
    "steam_appid": 2895740,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/483f5d1c89caab0e2fef396b6729c303.poster.avif?t=1748721304\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/483f5d1c89caab0e2fef396b6729c303.webm?t=1748721304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/483f5d1c89caab0e2fef396b6729c303.mp4?t=1748721304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engage in asynchronous T<u>urn-Based Strategy</u>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate and evolve unique mushroom species. Compete for dominance across many worlds,\u00a0 each with a dynamic ecosystem of wind, events and climate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/c670d7274dae14d73fa841d3a2fd908d.poster.avif?t=1748721304\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/c670d7274dae14d73fa841d3a2fd908d.webm?t=1748721304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/c670d7274dae14d73fa841d3a2fd908d.mp4?t=1748721304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer and solo modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Friends or the CPU; whomever lands <strong>Spores</strong> nearby, thoughtful turn mechanics will provide surprise and discovery on every turn as you cohabitate the living environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Show off your favorite spores with funky cosmetics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and swap Skins, Caps, and Staves! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/2ee3333d197764137691224711613aeb.poster.avif?t=1748721304\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/2ee3333d197764137691224711613aeb.webm?t=1748721304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/2ee3333d197764137691224711613aeb.mp4?t=1748721304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build customizations and unlocks</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playable <strong>Spore</strong> has secrets to unlock on your quest to thrive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your match earnings in the skill tree to access new Blooms and playstyles, trait abilities, lab definitions and cosmetics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally generated maps for varied gameplay</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps utilize procedural generation to foster innovative puzzle-like challenges, including varied shapes, resources, special tiles, and dynamic events. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop extensive underground networks or concentrate on efficient mushroom cultivation and abilities!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inspired by real-world mycology and ecosystems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by <strong>solo indie developer</strong> and <strong>mycology enthusiast</strong> Jake Collinge, the mechanics are<strong>\u00a0</strong>inspired by real mushroom ecology: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat detritus \u2018waste\u2019 material </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parasitize opponent mushrooms </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow above and below ground </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form mutual relationships to earn Nitrogen </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out humus and other resources </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React to the environment: wind direction, humidity and soil quality </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your underground territory </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut off opponent resources </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and much more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse mushroom species with unique abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SporeBloom: Mycelium Master</strong> will continue to expand post release, introducing new  playable <strong>Spores</strong>, mushrooms, traits, abilities, maps and cosmetics, flexing the immense variety of techniques real mushrooms use to survive</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/483f5d1c89caab0e2fef396b6729c303.poster.avif?t=1748721304\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/483f5d1c89caab0e2fef396b6729c303.webm?t=1748721304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/483f5d1c89caab0e2fef396b6729c303.mp4?t=1748721304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engage in asynchronous T<u>urn-Based Strategy</u>!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate and evolve unique mushroom species. Compete for dominance across many worlds,\u00a0 each with a dynamic ecosystem of wind, events and climate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/c670d7274dae14d73fa841d3a2fd908d.poster.avif?t=1748721304\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/c670d7274dae14d73fa841d3a2fd908d.webm?t=1748721304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/c670d7274dae14d73fa841d3a2fd908d.mp4?t=1748721304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer and solo modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Friends or the CPU; whomever lands <strong>Spores</strong> nearby, thoughtful turn mechanics will provide surprise and discovery on every turn as you cohabitate the living environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Show off your favorite spores with funky cosmetics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and swap Skins, Caps, and Staves! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/2ee3333d197764137691224711613aeb.poster.avif?t=1748721304\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/2ee3333d197764137691224711613aeb.webm?t=1748721304\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2895740/extras/2ee3333d197764137691224711613aeb.mp4?t=1748721304\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build customizations and unlocks</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playable <strong>Spore</strong> has secrets to unlock on your quest to thrive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your match earnings in the skill tree to access new Blooms and playstyles, trait abilities, lab definitions and cosmetics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally generated maps for varied gameplay</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps utilize procedural generation to foster innovative puzzle-like challenges, including varied shapes, resources, special tiles, and dynamic events. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop extensive underground networks or concentrate on efficient mushroom cultivation and abilities!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inspired by real-world mycology and ecosystems</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by <strong>solo indie developer</strong> and <strong>mycology enthusiast</strong> Jake Collinge, the mechanics are<strong>\u00a0</strong>inspired by real mushroom ecology: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat detritus \u2018waste\u2019 material </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parasitize opponent mushrooms </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow above and below ground </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form mutual relationships to earn Nitrogen </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out humus and other resources </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React to the environment: wind direction, humidity and soil quality </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your underground territory </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut off opponent resources </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and much more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse mushroom species with unique abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SporeBloom: Mycelium Master</strong> will continue to expand post release, introducing new  playable <strong>Spores</strong>, mushrooms, traits, abilities, maps and cosmetics, flexing the immense variety of techniques real mushrooms use to survive</p>",
    "short_description": "A fungi-fueled 'battle of nutrition!' Turn-based strategy inspired by mycelium networks and territory control. Produce fantastical mushrooms and expand to outgrow your rivals. Develop peacefully or parasitize your friends in multiplayer and solo play - may the fittest fungi survive!",
